# sbie-rt example dynamic box configuration (dynamic-box-arch)
#
# Feed to:  sbie-rt create dynamic-box.kv
#
# This is the LEGACY FLAT form of the KV stream API_BOX_CREATE parses:
# "Key=Value" lines without any [section] header all land in the box
# section itself.  The preset files (standard/hardened/privacy/appc.kv)
# use the multi-section form: a self-contained blob that also carries
# [TemplateDefaultPaths] + [TemplateNetworkPaths] skeleton sections plus
# [BoxConfig] for the box itself -- the driver embeds no defaults.
#
# Any Sandboxie.ini box setting is legal here; lines '#' / ';' are
# comments, repeated keys append (list semantics).  Enabled=y is forced
# by the driver when not supplied.  The %SANDBOX% variable expands to
# the generated box name (BoxConfig_<id>), %USER% / %SID% / %SESSION%
# to the box identity captured at create time.

# --- box roots (the defaults below mirror the classic ini defaults) ---
FileRootPath=\??\%SystemDrive%\Sandbox\%USER%\%SANDBOX%
KeyRootPath=\REGISTRY\USER\Sandbox_%USER%_%SANDBOX%
IpcRootPath=\Sandbox\%USER%\%SANDBOX%\Session_%SESSION%

# --- example policy settings ---
#OpenIpcPath=*\BaseNamedObjects*\MySharedMutex
#ClosedFilePath=\Device\SomeDevice
#NetworkAccess=open    # TemplateNetworkPaths preset: open | block
#DropAdminRights=y
NoAutoExit=y
